      "operation": "remove-liquidity",
      "warnings": [
        "Legacy exit-only admission: the official Synapse mainnet announcement dated 2021-08-29 directs users to unstake, remove liquidity and migrate out of former Nerve pools while discontinuing NRV rewards. This does not revive Nerve deposits, trading, incentives or bridge operations. The notice does not assert an all-pool pause, and no live pause state is claimed.",
        "Call this exact original BSC 3pool deployment, not its LP token, a metapool, bridge, linked library or successor Synapse pool. Constructor-bound order is BUSD (0xe9e7CEA3DedcA5984780Bafc599bD69ADd087D56), USDT (0x55d398326f99059fF775485246999027B3197955), USDC (0x8AC76a51cc950d9822D68b83fE1Ad97B32Cd580d), all 18 decimals on BSC. minAmounts must have three entries in that order and native asset units. These Binance-Peg assets are not interchangeable with Ethereum-native stablecoins.",
        "amount is 18-decimal Nerve 3pool LP (3NRV-LP) units. Caller must hold LP tokens and grant the pool sufficient allowance for burnFrom; staked LP must first be unstaked through a separately unadmitted staking contract. Underlying outputs go to msg.sender, with no configurable recipient. Nonpayable call requires zero native BNB value.",
        "Caller sets LP amount, each token minimum and deadline. Output uses recorded balances and total LP supply, reduces the burned amount by the current time-decaying withdrawal fee, then truncates proportional outputs. LP transfers reset/weight recipient withdrawal-fee accounting; historical documentation of zero fees is not a guarantee of current fees. Minimums are checked before token transfers and do not guarantee net receipt from taxed/nonstandard tokens.",
        "Proportional removal deliberately remains callable while paused and avoids the invariant solver, but balances, LP supply, token transfers, allowance, deadline and live configuration can still make it revert. BUSD lifecycle, Binance-Peg backing/custody and stablecoin depeg risks remain; no token backing, liquidity or successful redemption is established.",
        "Exact-address source/ABI provenance and source-service match are not a fresh runtime bytecode, configuration, financial-safety, execution-success or complete-workflow attestation. Catalog metadata assigns no API-key grant and bypasses no independent authorization or pause control."
      ]
